---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const description = 'A sensory-record prototype for presenting Vaelinya through illustration, atmosphere, language and connected cultural evidence.';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sensory Record Prototype" description={description} noindex={true}>
  <article class="sr-prototype" aria-labelledby="sr-title">
    <header class="sr-masthead">
      <div class="sr-intro">
        <p class="sr-kicker">Vaelinya Digital Experience Studio · DS-01.1</p>
        <h1 id="sr-title">Enter the record through what can be sensed.</h1>
        <p class="sr-deck">Each record begins with atmosphere, image and emotional language, then opens into story, place, speech and cultural connections.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="sr-orientation" aria-label="Sensory record orientation">
        <p class="sr-label">Reading route</p>
        <ol class="sr-route">
          <li>Notice the scene</li>
          <li>Read its feeling</li>
          <li>Follow the senses</li>
          <li>Open connected records</li>
        </ol>
      </aside>
    </header>

    <section class="sr-review-strip" aria-labelledby="review-state-title">
      <div>
        <p class="sr-label" id="review-state-title">Living background check</p>
        <p>The page keeps the existing time-of-day system visible around and through the record surface.</p>
      </div>
      <nav class="sr-state-links" aria-label="Preview time-of-day backgrounds">
        <a href="?vaelinya-state=dawn">Dawn</a>
        <a href="?vaelinya-state=day">Day</a>
        <a href="?vaelinya-state=dusk">Dusk</a>
        <a href="?vaelinya-state=night">Night</a>
      </nav>
    </section>

    <section class="sr-section" aria-labelledby="sensory-records-title">
      <div class="sr-section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="sr-label">Sensory records</p>
          <h2 id="sensory-records-title">Four ways into Vaelinya</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Colour names the emotional weather; text and structure carry the meaning without colour.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sr-grid">
        <article class="sr-record" data-emotion="resolve">
          <figure class="sr-illustration" role="img" aria-label="Illustration slot: a mountain care-house above damaged ground at first light">
            <div class="sr-illustration-mark" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
            <div class="sr-illustration-copy">
              <span>Illustration slot</span>
              <strong>Care-house above wounded ground</strong>
            </div>
            <figcaption>Suggested view: first light, steep paths, repaired walls and the damaged land below.</figcaption>
          </figure>

          <div class="sr-record-body">
            <div class="sr-record-head">
              <p class="sr-label">Story record 004</p>
              <span class="sr-status">Published</span>
            </div>
            <p class="sr-emotion"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Emotional weather: resolve</p>
            <h3><a href="/read/fables/the-mountain-healers-who-would-not-help-their-own/">The Mountain Healers Who Would Not Help Their Own</a></h3>
            <p class="sr-summary">Mera is injured by a care-house that records concern but refuses to change. Lina follows the promises, the land and the workers’ evidence.</p>

            <dl class="sr-senses">
              <div><dt>Sight</dt><dd>White stone, broken terraces, inked injury records.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Sound</dt><dd>Wind at shutters; careful voices behind a closed door.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Touch</dt><dd>Cold rails, steep steps, a body bracing against pain.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>After-feeling</dt><dd>Anger becoming steady public witness.</dd></div>
            </dl>

            <p class="sr-connections"><strong>Follow:</strong> work · care · promises · institutional harm · repair</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="sr-record" data-emotion="trust">
          <figure class="sr-illustration" role="img" aria-label="Illustration slot: the word rith written beside a speaker addressing a small gathering">
            <div class="sr-illustration-mark" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
            <div class="sr-illustration-copy">
              <span>Illustration slot</span>
              <strong>A word spoken before witnesses</strong>
            </div>
            <figcaption>Suggested view: hand lettering, open posture and listeners gathered close enough to answer.</figcaption>
          </figure>

          <div class="sr-record-body">
            <div class="sr-record-head">
              <p class="sr-label">Language record 001</p>
              <span class="sr-status">Canonical</span>
            </div>
            <p class="sr-emotion"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Emotional weather: trust</p>
            <div class="sr-word">
              <div class="sr-word-form">
                <strong>rith</strong>
                <span>truth</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3><a href="/language/">A living word</a></h3>
                <p class="sr-summary"><em>Ena rith vakal</em> means “I speak truth.” It is a public greeting, but also a promise that the speaker may be answered.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <dl class="sr-senses">
              <div><dt>Voice</dt><dd>Clear opening vowel; the final sound held briefly.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Mouth-feel</dt><dd>Forward, deliberate and difficult to mutter.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Gesture</dt><dd>Open palm, level gaze, room left for reply.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>After-feeling</dt><dd>Safety created by accountable speech.</dd></div>
            </dl>

            <p class="sr-connections"><strong>Follow:</strong> naerith · vakal · Lina · greeting · witness</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="sr-record" data-emotion="wonder">
          <figure class="sr-illustration" role="img" aria-label="Illustration slot: the Rim settlement seen through changing weather and a wide border landscape">
            <div class="sr-illustration-mark" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
            <div class="sr-illustration-copy">
              <span>Illustration slot</span>
              <strong>The Rim under moving weather</strong>
            </div>
            <figcaption>Suggested view: layered distance, inhabited edges and weather arriving across the border.</figcaption>
          </figure>

          <div class="sr-record-body">
            <div class="sr-record-head">
              <p class="sr-label">World record 001</p>
              <span class="sr-status">Canonical</span>
            </div>
            <p class="sr-emotion"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Emotional weather: wonder</p>
            <h3><a href="/world/the-rim/">The Rim</a></h3>
            <p class="sr-summary">A place record should make the reader feel where they are before it explains borders, people, customs and story routes.</p>

            <dl class="sr-senses">
              <div><dt>Light</dt><dd>Long horizons; weather changing the colour of distance.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Sound</dt><dd>Loose signs, low conversation and approaching rain.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Air</dt><dd>Cool, mineral and exposed at the settlement edge.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>After-feeling</dt><dd>Curiosity held beside caution.</dd></div>
            </dl>

            <p class="sr-connections"><strong>Follow:</strong> Rimaeri · Lina · local words · weather · borders</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="sr-record" data-emotion="belonging">
          <figure class="sr-illustration" role="img" aria-label="Illustration slot: hand-held chant cards being used by a small group">
            <div class="sr-illustration-mark" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
            <div class="sr-illustration-copy">
              <span>Illustration slot</span>
              <strong>Words carried in the hand</strong>
            </div>
            <figcaption>Suggested view: worn paper, shared rhythm marks and several hands using the cards together.</figcaption>
          </figure>

          <div class="sr-record-body">
            <div class="sr-record-head">
              <p class="sr-label">Collection record 001</p>
              <span class="sr-status">Published</span>
            </div>
            <p class="sr-emotion"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Emotional weather: belonging</p>
            <h3><a href="/artefacts/chant-cards/">Chant cards</a></h3>
            <p class="sr-summary">A small artefact can move language out of explanation and into breath, rhythm, memory and shared use.</p>

            <dl class="sr-senses">
              <div><dt>Material</dt><dd>Warm paper, softened corners and visible handling.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Rhythm</dt><dd>Short repeated lines that settle when voices join.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Use</dt><dd>Held close, passed around, marked and remembered.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>After-feeling</dt><dd>Private uncertainty becoming collective confidence.</dd></div>
            </dl>

            <p class="sr-connections"><strong>Follow:</strong> language · song · story use · printable objects</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sr-section" aria-labelledby="connections-title">
      <div class="sr-section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="sr-label">Connected archive</p>
          <h2 id="connections-title">Continue by relationship, not category</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <nav class="sr-paths" aria-label="Connected Vaelinya records">
        <a href="/read/lina/"><span>Person and story</span><strong>Meet Lina</strong></a>
        <a href="/language/lexicon/"><span>Spoken language</span><strong>Open the lexicon</strong></a>
        <a href="/world/culture/the-warm-remembering/"><span>Cultural practice</span><strong>The Warm Remembering</strong></a>
        <a href="/read/fables/"><span>Story collection</span><strong>Read the fables</strong></a>
      </nav>
    </section>

    <footer class="sr-review-gate">
      <div>
        <p class="sr-label">Screenshot review gate</p>
        <p><strong>Build first.</strong> Then review desktop and 390 px mobile captures before any production adoption.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="sr-review-list">Check: illustration hierarchy · sensory scan order · emotion labels · type density · dawn/day/dusk/night background continuity.</p>
    </footer>
  </article>

  <style>
    :global(:root) {
      --sr-paper: rgba(246, 239, 221, 0.94);
      --sr-paper-solid: #f6efdd;
      --sr-paper-deep: #e8dcc1;
      --sr-ink: #241d2d;
      --sr-muted: #625968;
      --sr-rule: rgba(63, 48, 62, 0.46);
      --sr-focus: #1710a8;
      --sr-max: 76rem;
    }

    .sr-prototype {
      max-width: var(--sr-max);
      margin: 1rem auto 2.5rem;
      color: var(--sr-ink);
      background: var(--sr-paper);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.36);
      box-shadow: 0 1rem 3rem rgba(9, 5, 18, 0.24);
      backdrop-filter: blur(0.35rem);
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    }

    .sr-prototype *,
    .sr-prototype *::before,
    .sr-prototype *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .sr-prototype a:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--sr-focus);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .sr-masthead,
    .sr-section,
    .sr-review-strip,
    .sr-review-gate {
      padding: clamp(0.9rem, 2.2vw, 1.65rem);
    }

    .sr-masthead {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.55fr) minmax(15rem, 0.75fr);
      gap: 1.4rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--sr-ink);
    }

    .sr-kicker,
    .sr-label,
    .sr-status,
    .sr-emotion,
    .sr-senses dt,
    .sr-connections,
    .sr-state-links,
    .sr-paths span,
    .sr-review-strip p,
    .sr-review-gate p,
    .sr-illustration-copy,
    .sr-illustration figcaption {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    .sr-kicker,
    .sr-label {
      margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.69rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.11em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .sr-masthead h1 {
      max-width: 25ch;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.7vw, 2.75rem);
      line-height: 1.04;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .sr-deck {
      max-width: 64ch;
      margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(0.96rem, 1.4vw, 1.08rem);
      line-height: 1.48;
    }

    .sr-orientation {
      align-self: start;
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
    }

    .sr-route {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.28rem;
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--sr-muted);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .sr-review-strip {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
    }

    .sr-review-strip p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--sr-muted);
      font-size: 0.81rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .sr-state-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }

    .sr-state-links a {
      padding: 0.32rem 0.55rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      color: var(--sr-ink);
      font-size: 0.73rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .sr-section {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
    }

    .sr-section-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .sr-section-heading h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.1vw, 1.75rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .sr-section-heading > p {
      max-width: 43ch;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--sr-muted);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .sr-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }

    .sr-record {
      --sr-emotion: #7e5269;
      --sr-emotion-soft: rgba(126, 82, 105, 0.14);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
      min-width: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
    }

    .sr-record[data-emotion="resolve"] {
      --sr-emotion: #8d3f5f;
      --sr-emotion-soft: rgba(141, 63, 95, 0.15);
    }

    .sr-record[data-emotion="trust"] {
      --sr-emotion: #315c81;
      --sr-emotion-soft: rgba(49, 92, 129, 0.15);
    }

    .sr-record[data-emotion="wonder"] {
      --sr-emotion: #3f6f62;
      --sr-emotion-soft: rgba(63, 111, 98, 0.16);
    }

    .sr-record[data-emotion="belonging"] {
      --sr-emotion: #95572c;
      --sr-emotion-soft: rgba(149, 87, 44, 0.16);
    }

    .sr-illustration {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      align-items: end;
      min-height: 10rem;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--sr-paper-solid);
      background:
        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(25, 20, 38, 0.16), rgba(25, 20, 38, 0.82)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 22% 26%, var(--sr-emotion), transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(120deg, #57495b, #272133);
      border-bottom: 0.34rem solid var(--sr-emotion);
    }

    .sr-illustration::before,
    .sr-illustration::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .sr-illustration::before {
      inset: 0;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(112deg, transparent 0 13px, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045) 14px 15px),
        linear-gradient(20deg, transparent 42%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 43% 44%, transparent 45%);
      mix-blend-mode: screen;
    }

    .sr-illustration::after {
      right: 1rem;
      top: 1rem;
      width: 4.8rem;
      height: 4.8rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: -2.2rem 2.1rem 0 -1.65rem rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
    }

    .sr-illustration-mark,
    .sr-illustration-copy {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .sr-illustration-mark {
      align-self: start;
      font-size: 2.7rem;
      line-height: 0.8;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    .sr-illustration-copy {
      padding-left: 0.8rem;
    }

    .sr-illustration-copy span,
    .sr-illustration-copy strong {
      display: block;
    }

    .sr-illustration-copy span {
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
      font-size: 0.66rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.11em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .sr-illustration-copy strong {
      max-width: 27ch;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .sr-illustration figcaption {
      position: absolute;
      left: -9999px;
    }

    .sr-record-body {
      padding: 0.95rem;
    }

    .sr-record-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.7rem;
    }

    .sr-record-head .sr-label {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--sr-emotion);
    }

    .sr-status {
      padding: 0.15rem 0.42rem;
      border: 1px solid currentColor;
      border-radius: 0.2rem;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .sr-emotion {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.42rem;
      width: fit-content;
      margin: 0.62rem 0 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.22rem 0.5rem;
      color: var(--sr-emotion);
      background: var(--sr-emotion-soft);
      border-left: 0.25rem solid var(--sr-emotion);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 780;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .sr-emotion span {
      width: 0.48rem;
      height: 0.48rem;
      background: var(--sr-emotion);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .sr-record h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.52rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .sr-record h3 a {
      text-decoration-thickness: 0.07em;
      text-underline-offset: 0.13em;
    }

    .sr-summary {
      margin: 0.55rem 0 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .sr-word {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .sr-word-form {
      min-width: 6rem;
      padding-right: 0.8rem;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
    }

    .sr-word-form strong,
    .sr-word-form span {
      display: block;
    }

    .sr-word-form strong {
      color: var(--sr-emotion);
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
      line-height: 0.95;
    }

    .sr-word-form span {
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
      color: var(--sr-muted);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
    }

    .sr-senses {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
      border-left: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
    }

    .sr-senses div {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.62rem;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
    }

    .sr-senses dt {
      margin-bottom: 0.12rem;
      color: var(--sr-emotion);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .sr-senses dd {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.38;
    }

    .sr-connections {
      margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
      color: var(--sr-muted);
      font-size: 0.73rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .sr-connections strong {
      color: var(--sr-ink);
    }

    .sr-paths {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      border-top: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
      border-left: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
    }

    .sr-paths a {
      min-height: 5.8rem;
      padding: 0.8rem;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
      color: var(--sr-ink);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .sr-paths span,
    .sr-paths strong {
      display: block;
    }

    .sr-paths span {
      color: var(--sr-muted);
      font-size: 0.69rem;
    }

    .sr-paths strong {
      margin-top: 0.28rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .sr-review-gate {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      background: rgba(36, 29, 45, 0.94);
      color: var(--sr-paper-solid);
    }

    .sr-review-gate p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .sr-review-gate .sr-label {
      margin-bottom: 0.28rem;
      color: #e7c785;
    }

    .sr-review-list {
      align-self: end;
      color: rgba(246, 239, 221, 0.78);
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .sr-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .sr-paths {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .sr-prototype {
        margin-top: 0.4rem;
        backdrop-filter: none;
      }

      .sr-masthead,
      .sr-review-gate {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .sr-orientation {
        padding: 0.8rem 0 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
        border-left: 0;
      }

      .sr-review-strip,
      .sr-section-heading {
        display: block;
      }

      .sr-state-links {
        margin-top: 0.65rem;
      }

      .sr-section-heading > p {
        margin-top: 0.35rem;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      .sr-masthead,
      .sr-section,
      .sr-review-strip,
      .sr-review-gate {
        padding: 0.82rem;
      }

      .sr-masthead h1 {
        font-size: 1.85rem;
      }

      .sr-illustration {
        min-height: 8.8rem;
      }

      .sr-senses,
      .sr-paths {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .sr-word {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .sr-word-form {
        padding: 0 0 0.55rem;
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sr-rule);
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .sr-prototype *,
      .sr-prototype *::before,
